  Hmm! Let me do: pop elements until (and including) the body, then re-push the body? Hmm, that's hacky but effective: the insertion target becomes the body ✓.

  Hmm, hmm. Alternatively: keep a `body_element: Option<usize>` and in AfterBody/AfterAfterBody modes insert into it.

  Let me implement: on `</body>`, set `self.after_body_target = Some(body_el)` after popping, and in the AfterBody/AfterAfterBody modes, insert nodes into that target.

